# <emoji> <lowercase english subject ending with a period.>
#
# rules:
#   1. subject starts with one emoji, then a space.
#   2. the rest of the subject is lowercase english and ends with ".".
#   3. enforced by .githooks/commit-msg (setup: sh .githooks/setup.sh).
#
# common emojis:
#   ✨ feature     🐛 bug fix      ♻️ refactor    📝 docs
#   💄 ui/style    ⚡ performance   🔥 remove      🔧 config
#   🔐 security    ✅ tests         🚀 deploy      🩹 minor fix
